dictable BlueBalls, which can send you flying into the air in a random direction.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Special Items and Explosive Fun</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870660/extras/eb52c18c87ffd057373f000afc522aaa.avif?t=1728343651\" width=636 height=150 /></span><br><br>Unlock the Explosion skill, clearing all trees in the area and leaving a trail of fire for a short time. Look out for special relics via airdrops, it can remove the rain, providing unique advantages and helping you navigate tricky areas.",
